# Development environment, read by the root Makefile only (make dev, make migrate,
# make smoke). The product itself reads nothing but real environment variables
# (specs/09-operations.md §7). `make setup` copies this file to `.env` when none
# exists; `.env` is ignored by Git.
#
# The data directory points inside the clone so that development never touches
# the per-user data directory a DM's real campaigns live in. Remove the line to
# use that default instead. Relative paths are resolved from the repository root.
EMBERGLASS_DATA_DIR=.dev-data
EMBERGLASS_PORT=3000
